		"description": "API collection for Otto AI Backend - AI-powered Revenue Intelligence Platform\n\n**Authentication Modes:**\n- **DEV Mode (APP_ENV=DEV)**: No JWT token required - all requests work without authentication. Leave clerk_jwt_token empty or remove Authorization headers. The backend will automatically use a mock user.\n- **PROD Mode (APP_ENV=PROD)**: JWT token required - set clerk_jwt_token variable with a valid Clerk JWT token. All protected endpoints require authentication.\n\n**Note:** Individual requests have auth configured, but in DEV mode the backend ignores it and uses mock authentication. You can remove auth from requests in DEV mode if preferred.\n\nSee README.md for detailed authentication setup instructions.",
